{"id":"2d2cf287148220bf","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-pr-representable.md","title":"PR Functions Representable","display":"thm-pr-representable — PR Functions Representable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-pr-representable","aliases":["92-thm-pr-representable"],"display":"thm-pr-representable — PR Functions Representable","depends_on":["[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-tuple-graph-code]]","[[92-thm-representability]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）","source_status":"原书表示性思想的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-pr-representable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-pr-representable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pr-representable — PR Functions Representable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0b2170bf5b3075ce\" href=\"?note=0b2170bf5b3075ce\" title=\"92-thm-representability\">92-thm-representability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书表示性思想的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(f : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (function parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_k(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\Gamma_k(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (encoded graph of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (representability predicate in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pr\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(\\Gamma_k(f)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pr\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(\\Gamma_k(f)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>是原始递归函数</li>\n<li>本书的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span>以自然数集合为输入，所以函数可表示性通过<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a>中唯一固定的配对编码图<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_k(f)\">\\(\\Gamma_k(f)\\)</span>表达</li>\n<li>所有原始递归函数在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示</li>\n<li>这是可表示性定理的基础</li>\n<li>这里得到的是图码集的逐numeral强表示；若要使用通常带自由输入、输出变量且证明唯一输出的“函数表示公式”，还需另行给出从图码表示到该多元公式的解码与唯一性论证</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本条中的旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> 仍表示正负数码定义。强可定义函数另有内部唯一输出条件，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"be5eece035332f0c\" href=\"?note=be5eece035332f0c\" title=\"92-df-strongly-definable-function\">92-df-strongly-definable-function</a>；仅配对图码可定义不能直接省去该条件。原书对角函数强可定义性在 p. 102 的 Proposition 4 明确给出。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）。</p>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-tuple-graph-code","status":"resolved","id":"d03aab2a94232c0e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-tuple-graph-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-representability","status":"resolved","id":"0b2170bf5b3075ce","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-representability]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-tuple-graph-code","status":"resolved","id":"d03aab2a94232c0e","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma_k(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ (encoded graph of $f$, see [[92-df-tuple-graph-code]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ (arithmetic-strength assumption, see [[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]] and [[92-df-axiom-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ (arithmetic-strength assumption, see [[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]] and [[92-df-axiom-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ (representability predicate in $G$, see [[92-df-representable]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-tuple-graph-code","status":"resolved","id":"d03aab2a94232c0e","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本书的$\\mathrm{Rep}_G$以自然数集合为输入，所以函数可表示性通过[[92-df-tuple-graph-code]]中唯一固定的配对编码图$\\Gamma_k(f)$表达","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-strongly-definable-function","status":"resolved","id":"be5eece035332f0c","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"本条中的旧 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 仍表示正负数码定义。强可定义函数另有内部唯一输出条件，见[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]]；仅配对图码可定义不能直接省去该条件。原书对角函数强可定义性在 p. 102 的 Proposition 4 明确给出。","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q","status":"resolved","id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"算术强度核对：$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ 表示每条 $Q$ 公理在 $G$ 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]；若继续要求 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 $G$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_k(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pr\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(\\Gamma_k(f)))","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"G","d